
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SkillPoint Academy</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f8fafc;color:#1e293b}
header{background:#0f172a;color:white;padding:20px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav{background:#1d4ed8;padding:14px 6%;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none}
nav a:hover{color:#fde68a}
nav a:active{color:#fecaca}
section{padding:32px 6%}
.hero{background:#dbeafe}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px)}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:5px}
.btn:hover{background:#1e40af}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.cards{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.card{flex:1 1 220px;background:white;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;padding:20px}
.card:hover{border-color:#2563eb;background:#eff6ff}
.card:nth-child(even){border-top:4px solid #059669}
.card:nth-child(odd){border-top:4px solid #2563eb}
.card a{color:#2563eb}
.card a:visited{color:#7c3aed}
form{max-width:600px;background:white;padding:22px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px}
.field{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;margin:8px 0 16px;border:1px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:5px;font:inherit}
.field:focus{outline:3px solid #bfdbfe;border-color:#2563eb}
input:required{border-left:4px solid #2563eb}
input:disabled{background:#e2e8f0;cursor:not-allowed}
input[type=checkbox]:checked+label{color:#047857;font-weight:bold}
button{padding:12px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:white;border:0;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}
button:hover{background:#1e40af}
button:active{background:#be123c}
.label{display:block;margin-top:12px;background:#fff7ed;color:#9a3412;padding:8px;font:12px monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
footer{background:#020617;color:white;padding:25px 6%;text-align:center}
@media(max-width:550px){section{padding:24px 5%}.cards{flex-direction:column}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div><h2>SkillPoint Academy</h2><small>Learn something new every day</small></div><span>Student Portal</span></header>
<nav><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#courses">Courses</a><a href="#register">Register</a></nav>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<h1>Learn. Practice. Grow.</h1>
<p>Explore courses and build useful skills with practical lessons.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#courses">Explore Courses</a>
<span class="label">Pseudo-classes: :hover, :active</span>
</section>
<section id="courses">
<h2>Our Courses</h2>
<p>Hover over the cards. Alternate cards have different top borders.</p>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card"><h3>HTML Basics</h3><p>Learn page structure and HTML elements.</p><a href="#register">Join course</a></article>
<article class="card"><h3>CSS Styling</h3><p>Learn colors, spacing and responsive layouts.</p><a href="#register">Join course</a></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Web Design</h3><p>Practice by creating useful web pages.</p><a href="#register">Join course</a></article>
</div>
<span class="label">Pseudo-classes: :hover, :nth-child(even), :nth-child(odd), :visited</span>
</section>
<section id="register">
<h2>Student Registration</h2>
<form>
<label for="student">Student name (required)</label>
<input class="field" id="student" required placeholder="Enter your name">
<label for="email">Email (required)</label>
<input class="field" id="email" type="email" required placeholder="Enter your email">
<label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
<input class="field" id="phone" placeholder="Optional phone number">
<input type="checkbox" id="terms" required><label for="terms"> I agree to the registration details</label>
<br><br>
<button type="submit">Register</button>
<span class="label">Pseudo-classes: :focus, :required, :optional, :checked</span>
</form>
</section>
<footer><p>SkillPoint Academy | HTML + CSS Practice</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
